        !!    - effect of constants on graph
        !!    - function box compositions in the abstract
        !! 4. pure geometry
        !!    - conch spiral
        !!    - top / side blueprint
        !!    - spherical coordinates 1 & 2
        !!    - door-opening angle (uses arctan)
        !! 5. delving into four graphs via algebra, geometry, & sum formulas:
        !!    - the geometric interpretation of cosx+sinx and maximizing cosx+sinx
        !!    - the geometric interpretation of cosx+sinx and rewriting as sqrt(2)cos(x-eta/2) and proof via sum formulas
