        !!    - maximization of sinx.cosx via isosets
        !!    - algebraic proof that sinx.cos <= 1/2 (easier) and that cosx+sinx <= sqrt(2) (harder)
        !! 6. 'constant ratio' geometry
        !!    - gas tank sphere
